{"id":"ugars736g78dc2anktwsy180g","title":"质谱仪为什么需要真空","originalTitle":"图解 质谱仪为什么需要真空？","summary":"质谱仪需要真空环境以减少离子与气体分子的碰撞，确保离子沿预定路径运动，提高分析的灵敏度和稳定性。真空泵持续抽走气体，降低腔体压力，使离子传输更稳定。真空并不推动离子或完成质量分离，而是为电场和磁场提供低碰撞的运行环境。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3549522&do=blog&id=1560890"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T05:47:36.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.497Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.497Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":30,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"66fe0454-43da-4709-9ec9-a2d5115a276e","title":"质谱仪真空环境作用层级与灵敏度量化关系研究及新技术展望"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"66fe0454-43da-4709-9ec9-a2d5115a276e","title":"质谱仪真空环境作用层级与灵敏度量化关系研究及新技术展望"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f8VOLu5gSJN4","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}